# Raw photo/screenshot uploads dropped in the repo root for processing.
# Processed, compressed copies live under assets/img/ and are tracked.
# Anchored to root (leading /) so assets/img/**/*.jpg is unaffected --
# git on macOS is case-insensitive by default, so *.JPG would otherwise
# also match tracked lowercase .jpg files under assets/.
/*.JPG
/*.jpeg
/Screenshot *.png
